  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Проект от BrassAmber Mods Organization:</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050784/description_a424b8b7-296b-47a1-b6a6-5eb8d269f545.png\" width=\"178\" height=\"178\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">По вопросам и дополнительной информации,<br>присоединяйтесь к нашему Discord здесь:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/PTeDmqUzq9\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/PTeDmqUzq9</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Добро пожаловать в Stronger Structures!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Современные версии классических подземелий из BetterDungeons для Minecraft 1.2.3. Этому выпуску Minecraft уже 15 лет, пора бы этим структурам уделить немного внимания и заботы</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Подземелья возвращаются!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Воздушный корабль</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/645/310/172/airship.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Бриг</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/675/310/172/brig.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Замок</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/676/310/172/castle.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Живое дерево</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/678/310/172/living_tree.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Город Незера</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/681/310/172/nether_city.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Пиратский флот</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/690/310/172/pirate_fleet.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Пиратское укрытие</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/691/310/172/pirate_hideout.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Крепость вулкана</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1246/692/310/172/volcano_fortress.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Официальный спонсор:&nbsp;<strong>GameTeam</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1365/50/banner_68f7a00764e0f_1761058823.png\"></span></p>",
